        "type": "update_note",
        "at": "2026-10-04T15:03:00.000Z",
        "text": "Pokémon’s prerelease page now lists October 24 as the first day of prerelease events."
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "The four Mega Evolution—Delta Reign prerelease promos are Enamorus, Kommo-o, Masquerain and Magmortar, first shown in coverage by ScreenRant.",
        "sourceIds": [
          "s2",
          "s3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "key_facts",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Each Build & Battle Box contains four Delta Reign booster packs, a 40-card deck and one of the four foil promos.",
            "sourceIds": [
              "s1",
              "s3"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Prerelease events begin October 24.",
            "sourceIds": [
              "s1"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Delta Reign releases November 6, 2026.",
            "sourceIds": [
              "s3"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "context",
        "text": "Build & Battle Box promos are randomly inserted, so a specific promo is not guaranteed from a single box."
      },
      {
        "type": "why_it_matters",
        "text": "Collectors chasing all four promos will need several boxes or singles; prerelease promos usually stay tied to these kits."
      },
